    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Every hour, look at what is coming up\nReminders are the difference between a registration and an\nattendee. This runs hourly rather than daily because a one-hour\nreminder sent at the wrong time of day is worse than none.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "414370842819",
      "name": "1. Every hour, look at what is coming up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Work out who is due which reminder\nTwo reminders per person per event: one a day ahead, one an hour\nahead. remindersSent on the registration is the counter, so a\nrestart or a re-run cannot send the same reminder twice.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "016170292175",
      "name": "2. Work out who is due which reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send it and mark it sent\nThe counter is written straight after the send. If the send\nfails the counter does not move, so the next hourly run tries\nagain rather than skipping the person entirely.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 860,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "075589529102",
      "name": "3. Send it and mark it sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        160
      ]
    }
